text: ["As Cavern of Souls enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a creature spell of the chosen type, and that spell can't be countered.", 'Blackcleave Cliffs enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or fewer other lands.\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Bountiful Promenade enters the battlefield tapped unless you have two or more opponents.\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', "Celestial Colonnade enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.\n{3}{W}{U}: Until end of turn, Celestial Colonnade becomes a 4/4 white and blue Elemental creature with flying and vigilance. It's still a land.", 'Copperline Gorge enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or fewer other lands.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', "Creeping Tar Pit enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.\n{1}{U}{B}: Creeping Tar Pit becomes a 3/2 blue and black Elemental creature until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn. It's still a land.", 'Darkslick Shores enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or fewer other lands.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Luxury Suite enters the battlefield tapped unless you have two or more opponents.\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Morphic Pool enters the battlefield tapped unless you have two or more opponents.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Razorverge Thicket enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or fewer other lands.\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', 'Sea of Clouds enters the battlefield tapped unless you have two or more opponents.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Seachrome Coast enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or fewer other lands.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Spire Garden enters the battlefield tapped unless you have two or more opponents.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Valakut, the Molten Pinnacle enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhenever a Mountain enters the battlefield under your control, if you control at least five other Mountains, you may have Valakut, the Molten Pinnacle deal 3 damage to any target.\n{T}: Add {R}.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Arid Mesa: Search your library for a Mountain or Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Bloodstained Mire: Search your library for a Swamp or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Flooded Strand: Search your library for a Plains or Island card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Marsh Flats: Search your library for a Plains or Swamp card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Misty Rainforest: Search your library for a Forest or Island card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Polluted Delta: Search your library for an Island or Swamp card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Prismatic Vista: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Scalding Tarn: Search your library for an Island or Mountain card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Verdant Catacombs: Search your library for a Swamp or Forest card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Windswept Heath: Search your library for a Forest or Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Wooded Foothills: Search your library for a Mountain or Forest card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G} or {W}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Horizon Canopy: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Strip Mine: Destroy target land.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Wasteland: Destroy target nonbasic land.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}. Each opponent gains 1 life.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Ancient Tomb deals 2 damage to you.']
